WEBVTT

00:12:26.138 --> 00:12:30.668
Till this trial continues,
competition will keep ending on it's own.

00:12:30.668 --> 00:12:32.528
Can I try this?
Can you follow me?

00:12:32.528 --> 00:12:35.678
SP: Yes. 
I can't dance as well as you.

00:12:35.678 --> 00:12:38.548
SRK: I'm not going to make you dance,

00:12:38.548 --> 00:12:41.858
I want you to follow me so I can say
"Sundar Pichhai followed me."

00:12:41.858 --> 00:12:45.028
(Laughter and applause)

00:12:50.178 --> 00:12:51.738
I want to tell you Sundar

00:12:51.738 --> 00:12:54.768
that Google for all of us,
mostly we think of it

00:12:54.768 --> 00:12:58.618
as it started off as just a search engine
which is completely wrong

00:12:58.618 --> 00:13:01.138
and misplaced and a misconception.